  "stageId": "main_03-01",
  "title": "Meeting",
  "storyCode": "3-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "675dd4a76707496805e977127af0d6cf20e033e964448506e46950769d4bfb9e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Madam..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Speak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Most of Reunion's forces have retreated already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, we're also done here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Tsk..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "About those Reunion suspects that we rounded up a few days ago..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Have we been able to get any information out of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Suspect",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does this crossbow look familiar to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Suspect",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're able to draw it, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's the structure of the ammunition? How does it work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What were you doing in the slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What were you doing in Lungmen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Suspect",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "...Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "They won't say a word."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Or perhaps... they just don't know anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Like the other Reunion members we defeated, they're probably nothing more than obedient puppets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "...Make them speak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Use any methods necessary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I want to know about their squads, their leadership, their strategies, where they're from, and what they plan to do..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Get everything out of them that you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "I want everything I can get."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Report back to me right away, no matter how insignificant it might seem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Has the L.G.D. ever arrested Reunion members before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We can't say for sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "In the end, it's just speculation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Get me in touch with Hoshiguma!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "How's the Special Operations Division faring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Are they still being overwhelmed by a single Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Reunion seems to have pulled back on their end as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Inspector Hoshiguma is worried about a possible trap and is trying to rule out all risks..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Hmph... Just a single person..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Who the hell do they think they are, coming and going like that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "You should already know what your next mission is going to be, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We're going to get Misha back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "This will be the joint operation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "The L.G.D. will take the lead, while Rhodes Island will be in charge of recon and the assault."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Your mission is complete as long as you can stall Reunion's retreat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "If we're looking for the enemy... won't we also risk being discovered?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Right now, we also don't have enough support for our recon squad..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "We can't do this on our own."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We should leave this to the professionals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Franka, help me get in touch with Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We're going to need another favor from Exusiai and Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
